teel fasteners, steel grating and expanded metal, wire and wire mesh, metal building systems, insulated metal panels, steel racking, overhead doors, and utility towers and structures for communications and energy transmission. This segment is also involved in the piling distribution business. The Raw Materials segment produces direct reduced iron (DRI); brokers ferrous and nonferrous metals, pig iron, hot briquetted iron, and DRI; supplies ferro-alloys; processes ferrous and nonferrous scrap metal; and engages in the natural gas production and industrial gas business. This segment sells its ferrous scrap to electric arc furnace steel mills and foundries for manufacturing process; and nonferrous scrap metal to aluminum can producers, secondary aluminum smelters, steel mills and other processors, and consumers of various nonferrous metals. Nucor Corporation was founded in 1905 and is based in Charlotte, North Carolina.","employees":33000,"website":"https://nucor.com","country":"United States","city":"Charlotte","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Leon J. Topalian","title":"Chairman of the Board & CEO"},{"name":"Mr. Stephen D. Laxton","title":"President & COO"},{"name":"Mr. K. Rex Query","title":"Executive Vice President of Strategy"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":12.14,"tpe":18.84,"ps":2.353,"pfcf":22.99,"peg":1.71,"pb":2.363,"ev_ebitda":9.426,"rev_growth":0.165,"eps_growth":0.461,"eps_growth_fwd":0.3332,"eps_growth_next":0.1502,"div_yield":0.0088,"roe":0.1206,"roa":0.06766,"de":44.82,"gross_margin":0.3339,"op_margin":0.1746,"profit_margin":0.06777,"current_ratio":2.083},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":12.88,"sector":12.14,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":17.24,"sector":18.84,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":1.582,"sector":2.353,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":39.96,"sector":22.99,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":5.21,"sector":1.71,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{